{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3XK6A8NSQ2VWW6BMA6R56","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「チャイくだチャイ」\n(恥ずかしくて少し小さい声で)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"と言ったら盛大に滑り倒しました"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"土生瑞穂です\n."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本日から福岡公演２日間スタートします\nそう、この２日で地方公演が。。\n終わってしまうらしいです。。。\n信じられないくらい早過ぎます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"改めて\n大阪／広島／宮城／愛知／福岡と\n２nd TOURも様々な地方へ訪れ\n発信することが出来ていること。\n本当に感謝の気持ちで一杯です。\n皆さんへお会いできて笑顔も一杯だよ😘"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とかいってめちゃ決めてる写真載せます"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3XM64V7N1C3GV053CXT5V","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まだ公演が終わっていないので\n私の口から言えることも少ないのですが\n来てくださった皆さんから\n沢山の楽しかったメッセージを沢山頂いて\n嬉しいな、幸せだなと思っております。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3XN5XCC9Y7AM4H21S97TY","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3XPEHEP86HQW39JQBQ6BV","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も今回の演出凄く好きなので\nはやく今日明日の福岡公演へ\n来てくださる皆さんにも観ていただきたいな\n会場でお待ちしていますね🖐🏼♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3XQD37ZSK6ANHBGVC0Q79","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケータリングも全部美味しかったな、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHH3XRBB4ZA876NT5682QKW1","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"広島の南瓜の揚げもみじ絶対忘れない🥺"}],"source":"archive"}